WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:06.200
This is the staff admin. Every screen is in the menu on the left.

2
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:10.337
Screens are grouped: Pull List, Website, and Utilities for owners.

3
00:00:10.337 --> 00:00:16.661
Every screen has a ? beside its title. It explains what the screen does.

4
00:00:16.661 --> 00:00:23.224
The link at the bottom opens the full guide for that screen.

5
00:00:23.224 --> 00:00:27.884
Help is always at the bottom of the menu.

6
00:00:27.884 --> 00:00:33.268
Your name, top right, opens My account and Sign out.
